he OAuth client step robust[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]client[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]client: normalize gog's stored client JSON and pipe it to `gog auth [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]credentials set -`, skip keyring-held clients, validate `-c` files, let [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`-c` replace a stored client, and make fake gog reject what real gog [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rejects.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob-owned sign-in through gog's two-step remote flow[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]signin[dim] · [dim][/dim]after client[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]signin: replace the inherited-stdio `gog auth add` with gog's remote [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]step 1/2, a loopback listener plus browser opener, a validated paste [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt, flow auto-selection, a success page, and the new step renderer.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Guided setup, account choice, self-healing check, and summary[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]experience[dim] · [dim][/dim]after signin[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]experience: guided client setup with ~/Downloads discovery, the account [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker and shared resolver, self-healing stale grants, the in-place [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Calendar-API retry, the summary, additive JSON fields, and doctor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]alignment.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Help text, docs, and the final gate[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after experience[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: rewrite login help and environment text, regenerate CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]references, update the gcal contract, guide, and JSON/getting-started [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tables, and run the full gates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-eg","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-eg.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-cd0bd5be48dadc0a4b3a0723954223c7","started_at":"2026-10-30T13:47:19.578303+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"125213116ecc49b2ebcec002849a9eca1ce9163afbca4b0c11b38ee1d3765b5b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.2--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":745729},"commits":{"digest":"b37683fb2315d0e118c21c424a693bb91663acea4e0cda12d8ca2bf6c3dc56ae","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.2--mon/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"fecdf6ab88078e959df5be24de7cc976f1954cf39dac72f617965225d290dae8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.2--mon/meta.json","size_bytes":749},"state":{"digest":"6858e3c792cb650e0bc9062eb695f9efc50e32f72054b5e6cd1186edf449d0f5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.2--mon/state.json","size_bytes":210}},"finished_at":"2026-10-30T14:56:35.834256+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.2--mon","local_name":"bob-cli-eg.2--mon","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-eg","agent_clan_generation":"20261030094508","agent_session":"bob-cli-eg.2","agent_session_role":"mon","bead_id":"bob-cli-eg.2","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-eg","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-eg.2","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"mon","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-eg.2"},"source_run_id":"run-f88d84215fdefb9a7ab3522c6dc9282b","started_at":"2026-10-30T14:49:15.